                                // INSTANCE, not the gen block: golden writes
                                // `work@p0m` where `prefix` here is
                                // `work@p0m.gen_b`.  ref_typespec::Compare
                                // reads VpiName / VpiDefName / Actual_typespec
                                // and never VpiFullName, so this is exactness,
