                        //   :97  `tl_h_i[i].a_source[0+:(IDW-STIDW)]`
                        //        golden `[0+:8 - 1]` / `[0+:8 - 2]`  (WIDTH)
                        //   :105 `tl_h_i[i].a_source[IDW-1 -: STIDW]`
                        //        golden `[8 - 1-:1]` / `[8 - 1-:2]`  (BASE)
                        // The DEF-view copy of the same two paths keeps the
                        // IDENTIFIERS on BOTH sides (`[0+:IDW - STIDW]`,
