                        //
                        // MEASURED ON GOLDEN, `assign <tgt> = '{<op0>, ...}`,
                        // ELAB view, operand 0 (g1/g2/g3/g4):
                        //   inline `logic [11:0] x [1]` / `[0:0]` / `[1:0]` /
