                                //       on both sides (a SIZED literal is not
                                //       VpiSize()==-1)
                                //     the `'0` inside a member's TERNARY arm
                                //       (`w8:(clk)?v8:'0`) stays BIN `'0`
                                //       sz -1 on both sides -- the test is on
                                //       the member value ITSELF, never a
                                //       constant nested inside it
