                //     value is lost (golden stores UINT:0 for `1024'({64'h8000_
                //     0000})` as well as for the oracle's `128'({64'h3})`) —
                //     the mask ExprEval applies is built by a shift that wraps
                //     at every multiple of 64, so it comes out zero.
